[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://effects/step_dust.gd" id="0_lifecycle"]

; Effect C, the step dust. CHANGE-BRIEF.md revision 6.0.4 section C.3 holds
; every number below and godot/tests/test_step_dust_config.gd reads every one
; of them back.
;
; Two emitters under one root: Kick owns the direction, Puff owns the weight.
; Both one_shot, both local_coords off -- rule C6, a puff is LEFT BEHIND and
; must not slide along with the player who made it. This is the one effect in
; the project where local_coords on would be visibly wrong.
;
; The scene is drawn facing right. step_dust_driver.gd mirrors the instance
; with scale.x = -1 when the player runs left; whether a negative scale really
; mirrors the emission direction of a local_coords = false emitter is settled
; by the strip, not by this comment.
;
; Property names: initial_velocity_min/_max, scale_min/_max, damping_min/_max.
; NOT initial_velocity, scale or damping -- CHANGE-BRIEF.md section 0.2.

